        <p style="font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">Yes. A 5% increase in retention increases profit by 25% to 95% (Bain and Company). Members of loyalty programs generate 12 to 18% more incremental revenue per year than non-members. Starbucks Rewards accounts for approximately 60% of US company-operated revenue.</p>
