        <p style="font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">WhatsApp marketing sends one-way broadcast messages. WhatsApp loyalty is two-way — customers scan a QR code, earn points, check balances, and redeem rewards through WhatsApp conversation. Platforms like Reelo offer WhatsApp marketing. Samparka offers WhatsApp loyalty.</p>
